===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|boxen}}, replacing earlier {{m|enm|bixen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|byxen||made of boxwood}}, equivalent to {{suffix|en|box|en|id2=made of}}.

====Adjective====
{{en-adj}}

# Made of [[boxwood]].
